OL,3,AKing Harald V's coffin to be moved from
OL,4,Ahospital to Royal Palace in Oslo
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Harald V's coffin will shortly be
OL,7,Fmoved from Norway's national hospital
OL,8,Fto the Royal Palace in Oslo
OL,10,FHarald, who was on the throne for 35
OL,11,Fyears, died early on Friday at age 89
OL,13,FKing Haakon VIII has now taken the
OL,14,Fthrone following the death of his
OL,15,Ffather. He has opted to keep the
OL,16,Ffamily's long-standing royal motto:
OL,17,F"All for Norway"
OL,19,FThe Norwegian PM says "a whole nation
OL,20,Fis in mourning" following his death -
OL,21,FOslo's mayor says she has cancelled her
OL,22,Fwedding, which was scheduled for today
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
