OL,3,AKing Harald V's coffin to be moved from
OL,4,Ahospital to Royal Palace in Oslo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe late king was a popular leader and
OL,7,Fis credited with modernising the
OL,8,FNorwegian monarchy - he broke with
OL,9,Ftradition by marrying a commoner, Queen
OL,10,FSonja
OL,12,FFlowers are being laid at a memorial
OL,13,Fnear the palace, and the UK's King
OL,14,FCharles III shares his "most heartfelt
OL,15,Fcondolences"
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
